# Patch series. Every entry must match a patches/<id>.patch file whose SHA256
# matches, and every patches/*.patch must be declared here (checked on every
# pull request by build/checks/patch_integrity.sh and build/checks/
# manifest_schema.sh). Updates are reviewed pull requests only (rule 13.4).
patches:
  - id: "0100"
    name: SukiSU-Nova driver integration (drivers/kernelsu wiring)
    description: >-
      Wires the pinned SukiSU-Nova tree into the kernel build as a built-in
      driver (route A): registers drivers/kernelsu in drivers/Makefile and
      sources its Kconfig from drivers/Kconfig. Equivalent to the Makefile and
      Kconfig edits SukiSU-Nova's kernel/setup.sh performs at commit
      c60f21b9, re-recorded as a reviewed patch. The drivers/kernelsu symlink
      into the pinned submodule is created at build time by
      build/integrate_sukisu.sh (setup.sh's git clone/pull is never executed,
      project rule 13.4.2).
    source_url: https://github.com/SukiSU-Nova/SukiSU-Nova
    upstream_commit: c60f21b9e00e35e898f8d21e0612465b76b9beec
    sha256: 9399ff47e11121e252d253588b93eeca7ff10689598e96a48bee149229a5a8ea
    license: GPL-3.0-or-later
  - id: "0200"
    name: Drop Kconfig sources for the unpublished kernel/oplus_cpu trees
    description: >-
      The published OnePlusOSS tree sources kernel/oplus_cpu/*/Kconfig
      (cpufreq_health, uad, oplus_omrg, cpufreq_bouncing, oplus_overload,
      waker_identify) from drivers/soc/Kconfig and kernel/oplus_cpu/sched/Kconfig
      from init/Kconfig, but the kernel/oplus_cpu directory is not part of the
      OSS release, so stock kconfig aborts with 'can't open file'. The guarded
      blocks are removed. CONFIG_OPLUS_FEATURE_PERFORMANCE_SCHED is kept off in
      the build profiles because kernel/Makefile builds oplus_cpu/sched/ from
      it and that directory is likewise unpublished.
    source_url: https://github.com/OnePlusOSS/android_kernel_oneplus_sm8650
    upstream_commit: b2696d4a2bda11cb74de35f839ef0cf6ccc1b9cb
    sha256: 5806a720b8cd6dd37d8a9e215c873cb022c0a56ea966daaa42b8ac4c547d1190
    license: GPL-2.0-only
  - id: "0210"
    name: Drop the mm/mm_osvelte source from mm/Kconfig
    description: >-
      mm/Kconfig sources mm/mm_osvelte/Kconfig, but mm/mm_osvelte is published
      as a single file, not a directory, so stock kconfig aborts with
      'mm/Kconfig:1313: can't open file'. The source line is removed; the
      CONFIG_MM_OSVELTE symbol is undefined afterwards and mm/Makefile's
      obj- mapping for mm_osvelte.o therefore stays inert.
    source_url: https://github.com/OnePlusOSS/android_kernel_oneplus_sm8650
    upstream_commit: b2696d4a2bda11cb74de35f839ef0cf6ccc1b9cb
    sha256: ebd81474a3371bde7fc4b76c24139ff86ea21a5c43698226f7b1b31e78e1293a
    license: GPL-2.0-only
